{"version":2,"exportedAt":1774240571522,"story":{"title":"Penguin's Wild Spin","userPrompt":"A break dancing penguin","authorStyleId":"maurice-sendak","readingLevel":"growing","illustrationStyleId":"storybook_classic","pages":[{"pageNumber":1,"text":"Pip was no star. He lived in cold lands. All day he fished. But Pip had dreams. He liked to move. He liked to groove. He liked to spin. Not just in water. He wanted to dance!","illustrationPrompt":"Pip, a small penguin with bright eyes, stands on an iceberg. He looks longingly at the sky. Other penguins fish nearby, looking bored. The sky is a swirling mix of blues and purples. Style: Whimsical children's book illustration, cute, friendly, colorful. Colors: Cool blues, purples, and icy whites.","imageMeta":{"provider":"flux2","generatedAt":1774152279257,"durationMs":4499,"retries":0,"promptLength":651,"success":true,"prompt":"traditional children's book illustration, richly painted, warm detailed artwork, classic storybook quality, beautiful picture book art A small glossy black feathers on back and head, fluffy white feathers on belly penguin, large bright orange eyes with dreamy, longing expression, slightly oversized orange beak, one slightly crooked feather on his head, bright orange webbed feet, a small patch of downy feathers on his chest that never quite flattened, chubby build. Pip fishing in the cold waters, looking wistful as he imagines himself dancing. in Antarctic Coast, near the water's edge. Child-safe, friendly, no text, no words, no speech bubbles."}},{"pageNumber":2,"text":"One day, a box! It washed up near Pip. It had bright tape. It had strange songs. Pip pushed it open. A human thing! A record player! Music so wild! It shook Pip's toes.","illustrationPrompt":"Pip stands excitedly before a large, colorful box washed up on the shore. Music notes float from the box. The box has bright red and yellow tape. Style: Whimsical children's book illustration, cute, friendly, colorful. Colors: Bright reds, yellows, blues, and greens.","imageMeta":{"provider":"flux2","generatedAt":1774152279960,"durationMs":5199,"retries":0,"promptLength":636,"success":true,"prompt":"traditional children's book illustration, richly painted, warm detailed artwork, classic storybook quality, beautiful picture book art A small glossy black feathers on back and head, fluffy white feathers on belly penguin, large bright orange eyes with curious, surprised expression, slightly oversized orange beak, one slightly crooked feather on his head, bright orange webbed feet, a small patch of downy feathers on his chest that never quite flattened, chubby build. Pip discovering a colorful box (record player) washed up on the shore. in Antarctic Coast, on the beach. Child-safe, friendly, no text, no words, no speech bubbles."}},{"pageNumber":3,"text":"The music called to him. A funky sound. Pip felt a jolt! He tried a move. A small hop. Then a slide. He fell on his beak! But he liked the feel.","illustrationPrompt":"Pip attempts a dance move, slipping on the ice and landing face-first. He has a determined look on his face. The record player spins in the background. Style: Whimsical children's book illustration, cute, friendly, colorful. Colors: Icy blue, warm yellow from the sun, determined red in Pip's cheeks.","imageMeta":{"provider":"flux2","generatedAt":1774152279245,"durationMs":4483,"retries":0,"promptLength":653,"success":true,"prompt":"traditional children's book illustration, richly painted, warm detailed artwork, classic storybook quality, beautiful picture book art A small glossy black feathers on back and head, fluffy white feathers on belly penguin, large bright orange eyes with excited, clumsy, but determined expression, slightly oversized orange beak, one slightly crooked feather on his head, bright orange webbed feet, a small patch of downy feathers on his chest that never quite flattened, chubby build. Pip attempting his first dance moves and falling on his beak. in Antarctic Coast, on the beach near the box. Child-safe, friendly, no text, no words, no speech bubbles."}},{"pageNumber":4,"text":"Days went by. Pip kept at it. He watched the waves. They rolled and crashed. Like a spin! He watched the birds. They dipped and swayed. Like a slide! He was learning.","illustrationPrompt":"Pip practices his dance moves, mimicking the movement of the waves and the birds. He is starting to get the hang of it. The waves are stylized and friendly looking. Style: Whimsical children's book illustration, cute, friendly, colorful. Colors: Ocean blues, sky blues, bright greens for the ice, determined red in Pip's cheeks.","imageMeta":{"provider":"flux2","generatedAt":1774152308338,"durationMs":4488,"retries":0,"promptLength":723,"success":true,"prompt":"traditional children's book illustration, richly painted, warm detailed artwork, classic storybook quality, beautiful picture book art A small glossy black feathers on back and head, fluffy white feathers on belly penguin, large bright orange eyes with focused, determined, inspired expression, slightly oversized orange beak, one slightly crooked feather on his head, bright orange webbed feet, a small patch of downy feathers on his chest that never quite flattened, chubby build. Pip practicing his dance moves, inspired by the waves and birds. in Antarctic Coast, on the beach, with waves and birds visible in the background. Child-safe, friendly, no text, no words, no speech bubbles. [variation 1, unique composition]"}},{"pageNumber":5,"text":"The other birds laughed. \"Look at Pip!\" they cried. \"Silly bird!\" Pip felt sad. He hid in his house. He did not want to dance. He felt like a fool.","illustrationPrompt":"Pip stands inside his small ice block house, looking sad. Outside, other penguins point and laugh. The scene has a muted, sad color palette. Style: Whimsical children's book illustration, cute, friendly, colorful. Colors: Muted blues, grays, and whites, with a hint of sadness.","imageMeta":{"provider":"flux2","generatedAt":1774152284282,"durationMs":5025,"retries":0,"promptLength":987,"success":true,"prompt":"traditional children's book illustration, richly painted, warm detailed artwork, classic storybook quality, beautiful picture book art A small glossy black feathers on back and head, fluffy white feathers on belly penguin, large bright orange eyes with sad, embarrassed expression, slightly oversized orange beak, one slightly crooked feather on his head, bright orange webbed feet, a small patch of downy feathers on his chest that never quite flattened, chubby build. A medium standard black and white penguin coloring with variations of grey shading penguin, average brown eyes with mocking, amused expression, variety of beak shapes and sizes, some have scars or missing feathers, some are larger or smaller than average, varying shades of grey on their feathers, average build. Other penguins laughing at Pip, who is now hiding in his house looking sad. in Antarctic Coast, Pip's house visible, with other penguins nearby. Child-safe, friendly, no text, no words, no speech bubbles."}},{"pageNumber":6,"text":"Then came Glub! She was small. She was brave. She saw Pip's face. \"Why so sad?\" she asked him. Pip told her all. About the dance. About the laughs.","illustrationPrompt":"Glub, a small penguin with a kind face, stands outside Pip's house. She looks concerned. Pip peeks out of the doorway, looking dejected. Style: Whimsical children's book illustration, cute, friendly, colorful. Colors: Warm yellows, gentle blues, and a touch of hope.","imageMeta":{"provider":"flux2","generatedAt":1774152285904,"durationMs":5942,"retries":0,"promptLength":911,"success":true,"prompt":"traditional children's book illustration, richly painted, warm detailed artwork, classic storybook quality, beautiful picture book art A small glossy black feathers on back and head, fluffy white feathers on belly penguin, large bright orange eyes with sad, withdrawn expression, slightly oversized orange beak, one slightly crooked feather on his head, bright orange webbed feet, a small patch of downy feathers on his chest that never quite flattened, chubby build. A tiny glossy dark blue feathers on back and head, fluffy white feathers on belly penguin, small bright blue eyes with concerned, curious expression, small, pointed beak, a tiny tuft of feathers on her head that sticks straight up, bright yellow webbed feet, a slightly chipped beak, slim build. Glub approaching Pip and asking him why he's sad. in Antarctic Coast, near Pip's house. Child-safe, friendly, no text, no words, no speech bubbles."}},{"pageNumber":7,"text":"\"So what?\" said Glub. \"Dance for you! Dance for fun! The songs are wild! You are wild too! Don't let them stop you!\" Pip felt a spark.","illustrationPrompt":"Glub encourages Pip, holding her flipper out to him. Pip starts to smile, a spark of determination in his eyes. The record player sits between them. Style: Whimsical children's book illustration, cute, friendly, colorful. Colors: Bright yellows, oranges, and reds, symbolizing energy and enthusiasm.","imageMeta":{"provider":"flux2","generatedAt":1774152288567,"durationMs":4283,"retries":0,"promptLength":954,"success":true,"prompt":"traditional children's book illustration, richly painted, warm detailed artwork, classic storybook quality, beautiful picture book art A small glossy black feathers on back and head, fluffy white feathers on belly penguin, large bright orange eyes with listening, thoughtful expression, slightly oversized orange beak, one slightly crooked feather on his head, bright orange webbed feet, a small patch of downy feathers on his chest that never quite flattened, chubby build. A tiny glossy dark blue feathers on back and head, fluffy white feathers on belly penguin, small bright blue eyes with encouraging, supportive expression, small, pointed beak, a tiny tuft of feathers on her head that sticks straight up, bright yellow webbed feet, a slightly chipped beak, slim build. Glub encouraging Pip to dance for himself and not worry about what others think. in Antarctic Coast, near Pip's house. Child-safe, friendly, no text, no words, no speech bubbles."}},{"pageNumber":8,"text":"Pip took Glub's hand. The music played. He spun and slid. He hopped and swayed. Glub clapped loud. Other birds watched. They tapped their feet!","illustrationPrompt":"Pip and Glub dance together on the ice. Other penguins watch, tapping their feet and starting to smile. The scene is full of movement and joy. Style: Whimsical children's book illustration, cute, friendly, colorful. Colors: Bright blues, greens, yellows, and reds, representing happiness and energy.","imageMeta":{"provider":"flux2","generatedAt":1774152291744,"durationMs":6540,"retries":0,"promptLength":1268,"success":true,"prompt":"traditional children's book illustration, richly painted, warm detailed artwork, classic storybook quality, beautiful picture book art A small glossy black feathers on back and head, fluffy white feathers on belly penguin, large bright orange eyes with happy, confident expression, slightly oversized orange beak, one slightly crooked feather on his head, bright orange webbed feet, a small patch of downy feathers on his chest that never quite flattened, chubby build. A tiny glossy dark blue feathers on back and head, fluffy white feathers on belly penguin, small bright blue eyes with joyful, supportive expression, small, pointed beak, a tiny tuft of feathers on her head that sticks straight up, bright yellow webbed feet, a slightly chipped beak, slim build. A medium standard black and white penguin coloring with variations of grey shading penguin, average brown eyes with intrigued, curious expression, variety of beak shapes and sizes, some have scars or missing feathers, some are larger or smaller than average, varying shades of grey on their feathers, average build. Pip and Glub dancing together, while other birds start to watch and tap their feet. in Antarctic Coast, open area for dancing. Child-safe, friendly, no text, no words, no speech bubbles."}},{"pageNumber":9,"text":"Soon, all danced! Big birds, small birds. All in a line. A penguin party! Pip was so glad. He learned to dance. He learned to share. He learned to be brave.","illustrationPrompt":"All the penguins dance together in a long line, having a joyful party. Pip and Glub lead the dance. The record player blasts music. Style: Whimsical children's book illustration, cute, friendly, colorful. Colors: A vibrant mix of all colors, representing the joy and unity of the penguins.","imageMeta":{"provider":"flux2","generatedAt":1774152290916,"durationMs":5010,"retries":0,"promptLength":1243,"success":true,"prompt":"traditional children's book illustration, richly painted, warm detailed artwork, classic storybook quality, beautiful picture book art A small glossy black feathers on back and head, fluffy white feathers on belly penguin, large bright orange eyes with joyful, proud expression, slightly oversized orange beak, one slightly crooked feather on his head, bright orange webbed feet, a small patch of downy feathers on his chest that never quite flattened, chubby build. A tiny glossy dark blue feathers on back and head, fluffy white feathers on belly penguin, small bright blue eyes with happy expression, small, pointed beak, a tiny tuft of feathers on her head that sticks straight up, bright yellow webbed feet, a slightly chipped beak, slim build. A medium standard black and white penguin coloring with variations of grey shading penguin, average brown eyes with happy, enjoying expression, variety of beak shapes and sizes, some have scars or missing feathers, some are larger or smaller than average, varying shades of grey on their feathers, average build. All the penguins dancing together in a line, having a party. in Antarctic Coast, open area filled with dancing penguins. Child-safe, friendly, no text, no words, no speech bubbles."}},{"pageNumber":10,"text":"The cold lands glowed. With warmth and dance. Pip smiled wide. He was a star! Not because of skill. But because of heart. And Glub, his friend, smiled too. They danced on.","illustrationPrompt":"Pip and Glub stand together, smiling at the dancing penguins. The aurora borealis shines brightly in the background, creating a magical atmosphere. Style: Whimsical children's book illustration, cute, friendly, colorful. Colors: Warm yellows, oranges, and pinks blending with the cool blues and greens of the aurora borealis, representing happiness and friendship.","imageMeta":{"provider":"flux2","generatedAt":1774152292754,"durationMs":4185,"retries":0,"promptLength":953,"success":true,"prompt":"traditional children's book illustration, richly painted, warm detailed artwork, classic storybook quality, beautiful picture book art A small glossy black feathers on back and head, fluffy white feathers on belly penguin, large bright orange eyes with happy, content expression, slightly oversized orange beak, one slightly crooked feather on his head, bright orange webbed feet, a small patch of downy feathers on his chest that never quite flattened, chubby build. A tiny glossy dark blue feathers on back and head, fluffy white feathers on belly penguin, small bright blue eyes with happy, content expression, small, pointed beak, a tiny tuft of feathers on her head that sticks straight up, bright yellow webbed feet, a slightly chipped beak, slim build. Pip and Glub smiling at each other as they continue to dance, with the cold lands glowing with warmth. in Antarctic Coast, open area. Child-safe, friendly, no text, no words, no speech bubbles."}}],"generationMeta":{"textModel":"gemini-2.0-flash","imageProvider":"flux2","generatedAt":1774152256311,"totalDurationMs":40962,"textGenerationMs":0,"imageGenerationMs":55628,"totalImages":11,"successfulImages":11,"failedImages":0,"appVersion":"2.5.33","buildVersion":"58","firstBatchImageMs":23650,"timeToDisplayMs":23650},"coverImageMeta":{"provider":"flux2","generatedAt":1774152297272,"durationMs":4506,"retries":0,"promptLength":1313,"success":true,"prompt":"traditional children's book illustration, richly painted, warm detailed artwork, classic storybook quality, beautiful picture book art Color palette: icy blue, snow white, bright red, sunny yellow. A small glossy black feathers on back and head, fluffy white feathers on belly penguin, large bright orange eyes with dreamy expression, slightly oversized orange beak, one slightly crooked feather on his head, bright orange webbed feet, a small patch of downy feathers on his chest that never quite flattened, chubby build. Book cover for \"Penguin's Wild Spin\". Setting: A snowy, icy beach with large icebergs in the distance. The sky is a pale blue, and the ground is covered in snow and patches of dark rock. A small, roughly built penguin 'house' made of ice and rocks is visible.. Mood: heartwarming, inviting, magical atmosphere. high quality, professional children's book illustration, balanced detail, engaging, child-friendly Negative: scary, dark, frightening, violent, blood, gore, weapons, monsters, horror, photorealistic, photo, photograph, realistic human, adult content, nude, complex cluttered, busy overwhelming, text, words, letters, speech bubbles, dialogue bubbles, comic bubbles, captions, watermarks, signatures, labels, titles, distorted faces, extra limbs, deformed, ugly, creepy, nightmare"}},"images":{"cover":"data:application/octet-stream;base64,","page-1":"data:application/octet-stream;base64,","page-2":"data:application/octet-stream;base64,","page-3":"data:application/octet-stream;base64,","page-4":"data:application/octet-stream;base64,","page-5":"data:application/octet-stream;base64,","page-6":"data:application/octet-stream;base64,","page-7":"data:application/octet-stream;base64,","page-8":"data:application/octet-stream;base64,","page-9":"data:application/octet-stream;base64,","page-10":"data:application/octet-stream;base64,"}}